At stage 09, the address from the momo operation hosted a console titled ARTEX on October 8. ARTEX is the name of the framework on the Storm-0940 and VAPOR PANDA kill chain pages. The page links them for that name, and Wiz does not connect them, so do not present them as the same activity.

